.task-board/.resources/TASK-260720-1nvomm/TASK-260720-1nvomm_accepted-contract.md-896-For a real operation, hold a same-project operation lock from planning through handoff, and use provider-first closure order. Dry-run is lock-free and relies on the generation recheck in step 7. In addition, every real manager-home mutation uses one exclusive **manager-home mutation lock** shared by project, global, hybrid, adapter, consumer, cache-publication, recovery, and GC paths. A conforming implementation performs:
